{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id239812754"}, "name":{"label":"Dreynolds206"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-03T19:42:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.10.40"}, "id":{"label":"14748287420"}, "title":{"label":"I’m down with AllTrails"}, "content":{"label":"I wondered at first if AllTrails was really worth the sub price… I have used it enough to this point to say that the price is justified. It’s just a great, useful app. I personally love the little features like getting a general weather overview for your hike when you set the date and time, or getting a 3D elevation profile look at a hike. It’s an easy to use app, and has great up to date trail reviews and updates on trails that are always helpful. I use it to keep track of my hikes, to give and receive reviews/updates on hikes, and it has also helped with navigating and staying on the correct trail several times! Highly recommend AllTrails to anyone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=405075943&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
