{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1611464418"}, "name":{"label":"emilyexcalib"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-03T12:28:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.10.40"}, "id":{"label":"14747137975"}, "title":{"label":"Why is there an AI on this app"}, "content":{"label":"Don’t you think it is ironic they use something that is destroying nature to get you to visit nature?\n\nYou don’t need this app to help you go outside; just go outside.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=405075943&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id120758571"}, "name":{"label":"The bombdiggitty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-03T11:03:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.10.40"}, "id":{"label":"14746879998"}, "title":{"label":"Unexpected renewal and frustrating refund process"}, "content":{"label":"I was charged $38.15 for an annual renewal I did not intend to purchase. I canceled and disputed the charge four days later. Canceling stopped future renewals but did not refund the charge, and I couldn’t find an obvious refund-request option on the website.\n\nWhen I contacted AllTrails directly within 30 days of renewal, I was initially offered a 50% refund to keep the membership. I declined and requested a full refund. Support then said it could not process a refund because my card dispute was open.\n\nI’ve asked AllTrails to accept the dispute so this can be resolved. As of this review, I’m still waiting for a refund. This has taken far more effort than it should for a renewal I promptly canceled. Clearer renewal notices and a straightforward refund process would make a big difference.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=405075943&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
