{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id989431023"}, "name":{"label":"DontAgree2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-01T17:48:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.10.30"}, "id":{"label":"14740016017"}, "title":{"label":"Great app for hiking"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using Alltrails for 4 years now and I won’t go hiking without it anymore. First very very handy to filter all the trails in a certain area. That way you quickly find a trail that you very likely will enjoy. Then download the map so that when there is no longer cell reception it keeps working. Then during the hike at every junction find out which way to go, never get lost. And you can clearly see how far you are on the hike and climbing that steep slope. Finally collect all the stats at the end of the hike.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=405075943&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
